        "TileImage": "$($repository 38253678-92ae-438b-ab73-300cc5373553).Image",
        "Description": "We have the ark and our man. Blake Nathaniel, former MIT professor who disgracefully lost his tenure due to his unethical researches and who is obsessed with the Lost Ark, seems to have found new patrons in the Russians. He plans to open the ark tonight on a solemn ceremony. This can have disastrous consequences 47. You must eliminate Blake and his associates and then fly the Lost Ark back home. The Russians don&apos;t know the powers they are playing with. The ark cannot fall into the wrong hands.",
